msgstr "Podrška za distribuirane hash-tablice (DHT, inačica Mainline)"

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
#: org.kde.ktorrent.appdata.xml:33
msgid "Support for UPnP to automatically forward ports on a LAN with dynamic assigned hosts"
